---
import { caret } from "../../styles/objects/caret.styles";
import { keycap } from "../../styles/objects/keycap.styles";
import { wrap } from "../../styles/objects/layout.styles";
import { heroGrad } from "../../styles/objects/type.styles";
import Button from "../Button/Button.astro";
import WindowChrome from "../WindowChrome/WindowChrome.astro";
import { windowFrame } from "../WindowChrome/WindowChrome.styles";
import {
  actions,
  aurora,
  chip,
  chipLabel,
  chipMark,
  copy,
  field,
  floatCard,
  floatIcon,
  grid,
  hero,
  mock,
  mockBody,
  mockLabel,
  orb,
  pill,
  pills,
  stage,
  stageBox,
  title,
  wave,
  word,
} from "./Hero.styles";
---

<section class={hero} data-hero>
  <div class={aurora} aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class={orb({ place: "right" })} aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class={orb({ place: "left" })} aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class:list={[wrap, grid]}>
    <div>
      <h1 class={title}>
        <span class={word[0]}>入力する</span>
        <span class={word[1]}>場所に、</span><br />
        <span class={word[2]}><span class={heroGrad}>適切な言語</span></span>
        <span class={word[3]}>を。</span>
      </h1>
      <p class={copy}>
        入力欄にフォーカスするだけで、日本語と英語を自動で切り替え。「あ、英語のままだった…」を、もう終わりにしませんか。
      </p>
      <div class={actions}>
        <Button href="#download" desktopDownload>⬇ 今すぐダウンロード</Button>
        <Button href="#how" variant="sub">使い方を見る</Button>
      </div>
      <div class={pills}>
        <span class={pill}>⚡ 高速・低遅延で切り替え</span>
        <span class={pill}>🎯 入力欄ごとに設定</span>
        <span class={pill}>🔒 入力内容は読み取らない</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class={stageBox} aria-hidden="true">
      <div class={wave} aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class={floatCard({ place: "auto" })}><span class={floatIcon}>⚡</span>自動で切り替え</div>
      <div class={floatCard({ place: "rules" })}><span class={floatIcon}>✓</span>入力欄ごとにルール</div>
      <div class={floatCard({ place: "privacy" })}><span class={floatIcon}>🔒</span>入力内容は読み取らない</div>
      <div class={floatCard({ place: "shortcut" })}>
        <kbd class={keycap({ size: "mini" })}>⌘</kbd>
        <kbd class={keycap({ size: "mini" })}>⇧</kbd>
        <kbd class={keycap({ size: "mini" })}>L</kbd>
        で登録
      </div>
      <div class={stage} data-stage>
        <div class:list={[windowFrame, mock({ scene: "ja" })]}>
          <WindowChrome />
          <div class={mockBody}>
            <div class={mockLabel}>💬 チャット欄</div>
            <div class={field({ scene: "ja" })}>こんにちは<span class={caret()}></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class={chip({ tone: "ja" })}><span><b class={chipMark}>あ</b><small class={chipLabel}>日本語</small></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class:list={[windowFrame, mock({ scene: "en" })]}>
          <WindowChrome />
          <div class={mockBody}>
            <div class={mockLabel}>&lt;/&gt; コードエディタ</div>
            <div class={field({ scene: "en" })}>console.log("Hello")<span class={caret({ tone: "accent" })}></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class={chip({ tone: "en" })}><span><b class={chipMark}>A</b><small class={chipLabel}>英語</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
